# Two boxes talking: a set/reset latch (box "latch") drives a door brain (box "door"), plus a loose part and a wifi.
name latch + door brain demo
dev on button
dev off button Output=0
dev pir motion
dev wet water
dev dr door
dev lamp light
dev scr display
box latch
note "LATCH" "button 1 sets, button 0 resets: a memory remembers"
c m mem Value=0
w in1 m.in
w m.out out1
box door
note "DOOR" "open while someone was seen in the last 3 s AND nothing blocks it (latch or water held 5 s). An AND, not a relay: a relay switched off passes nothing, so the door would keep its last state."
c held or TimeFrame=3
c open and
c nb not
c wetor or TimeFrame=5
c block or
w in1 held.1
w in2 wetor.1
w in3 block.2
w wetor.out block.1
w block.out nb.in
w nb.out open.2
w held.out open.1
w open.out out1
part show concat Separator=": "
part label mem Value="LOCK"
part tx wifi Channel=42
part rx wifi Channel=42
wire on.out latch.in1
wire off.out latch.in1
wire latch.out1 door.in3 show.2 lamp.set_state
wire label.out show.1
wire show.out tx.in
wire rx.out scr.set_text
wire pir.state_out door.in1
wire wet.signal_out door.in2
wire door.out1 dr.set_state
watch latch.out1 door.out1
at 1 set pir 1
at 2 set pir 0
at 6 press on
at 7 set pir 1
at 9 press off
at 12 set wet 50
at 14 set wet 0
expect 1.5 dr = on
expect 5.5 dr = off
expect 8 dr = off
expect 8 scr = "LOCK: 1"
expect 10 dr = on
expect 13 dr = off
run 22
